        "sid": "ISA 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe ma Isaya ma wod Amoz uneno pi Yuda ku Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre i nindo ma cen, nia got mi ot pa Yehova bicungo wi usimbru gudi, man jubidode wi ungulu gudi; e thek ceke bicidho i bang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kodhidhanu dupa bicidho man gibiwacu kumae, Wubin, man wek waidhu ba got pa Yehova, ba ot pa Mungu pa Yakobo; e ebiponjowa ku yo pare, man wabiwotho i yo pare: kum cik biwok kud i Sayuni, man lembe pa Yehova kud i Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoe 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.4.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 4:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebipoko lembe i kind thek, e ebing’olo lembe pi kodhidhanu dupa; man gibithiedho palamularu migi ni kwejdhiang’, man tong’ migi ni uligu mi lwero piny; thek biting’o palamularu ngo kum thek, kadok lwiny de gibiponjo kendo ngo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ot pa Yakobo, wubin, man wek wawothu i der pa Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ikuno dhanu peri ma ot pa Yakobo, kum gipong’ ku kura m’uai yo nyangu, man gin ajoga calu Julilisti, man gigoyo cing’ ku nyithindho mi juwirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’om migi pong’ ku mola ma tar man mola ma kwar, kadi kajik moko de mbe mi piny m’akana migi; ng’om migi bende pong’ ku riuni, kadi kajik moko de mbe mi magali migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’om migi bende pong’ ku mungu m’araga; girwo ni tic m’i cing’gi gigi, gin ma cing’gi timo en. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ng’atu ma ng’ic ugung’ piny, man ng’atu ma dwong’ ujwigre gire: ka kumeno kud iwek lem migi woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 6:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TH.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tes 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mond i cana, man ipond i utur, kud i wang’ ndiri pa Yehova, man ni der mi dwong’ pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubijwigo wang’ mi tingri mi dhanu, man jubinyono kuhaya mi dhanu, e jubidodo Yehova kende i ceng’ maeca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ceng’ pa Yehova mir udul bibedo nuti wi jukuhaya ceke, man wi ju ma wigi pek ceke, man wi dhanu ceke m’utingri; e jubinyone piny; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wi musonge ceke mi Lebanon, ma gi boco gitingri malu de, man wi bongu ceke mi Bacan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wi gudi ma wiu ceke, man wi ungulu gudi ceke m’utingre malu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wi odkur ceke ma wiu kubang’e kubang’e, man wi gang’kidi ceke ma judwoko tek kubang’e kubang’e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wi combo mi Tarcic ceke, man wi gin ceke ma juketho cwiny i kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jubijwigo tingri mi dhanu piny, man jubijwigo kuhaya mi dhanu; e jubidodo Yehova kende i ceng’ maeca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E mungu m’araga bikadhu woko pet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu bicidho i odcana, man i odng’om, kud i wang’ ndiri pa Yehova, man ni der mi dwong’ pare, kinde m’eai kara eyeng ng’om gbe gbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ceng’ maeca dhanu bibayu mungu m’araga migi mi mola ma tar, man mungu m’araga migi mi mola ma kwar, ma jutimo kara girwo i bang’gi, ni vuyu man ni ulic; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara gicidh i odcana, man i kind cana m’ukak kud i wang’ ndiri pa Yehova, man ni der mi dwong’ pare, kinde m’eai kara eyeng ng’om gbe gbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwek dhanu, ma yuyo pare ni i odiume; kum jukwane ni gin moko ni kum ang’o?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
